  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1753806243_8320165_1ef6d64598d3c87f98e887230448c579.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"138\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><img src=\"https://primabiotic.com/cdn/shop/files/3_1.png?height=1200&amp;v=1750151765\" style=\"width: 510px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\"></p><p data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"138\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"138\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Primabiotic – Wellness That Works, Beauty From Within</span></strong></p><p data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"587\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong data-start=\"140\" data-end=\"173\">About Our Brand and Products:</strong><br data-start=\"173\" data-end=\"176\">Primabiotic is a wellness brand committed to helping people feel stronger, age better, and glow from the inside out. Our hero product—Primabiotic Collagen—is a ready-to-drink liquid formula featuring 10,000 mg of premium hydrolyzed collagen and 12 essential vitamins. Backed by science and trusted by beauty and fitness professionals, our products are designed for real life—easy, effective, and results-driven.</p><p data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"896\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"617\">What Makes Us Different:</strong><br data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"620\">We go beyond just collagen. Our growing line of wellness supplements reflects our belief in simplicity, quality, and daily rituals that make a difference. With clean ingredients, proven benefits, and a modern aesthetic, Primabiotic is redefining how people approach self-care.</p><p data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"1157\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"926\">How Affiliates Can Earn:</strong><br data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"929\">Affiliates earn competitive commissions on every purchase made through their unique referral link. You’ll also receive a custom discount code to share with your audience—helping them save while increasing your earning potential.</p><p data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1407\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><img src=\"https://primabiotic.com/cdn/shop/files/primabiotic-hyaluron-2-600x600.png?v=1753260593&amp;width=1800\" style=\"width: 357px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\"></p><p data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1407\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1181\">How to Promote Us:</strong><br data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1184\">Promote Primabiotic through your blog, Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, or any content platform. We provide branded assets, product education, and marketing support to help you create high-converting content and grow your reach.</p><p data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1662\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><img src=\"https://primabiotic.com/cdn/shop/files/4.png?height=1200&amp;v=1750151186\" style=\"width: 367px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\"></p><p data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1662\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><br></p><p data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1662\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1431\">Other Information:</strong><br data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1434\">We welcome affiliates who share our mission to inspire confidence, wellness, and longevity. Whether you're a content creator, fitness expert, or simply passionate about wellness, Primabiotic offers the perfect brand partnership.</p><p data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1759\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1759\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Join us—empower others to feel great and glow from within, while building your own success.</strong></p><p data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1759\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><strong data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1759\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><img src=\"https://primabiotic.com/cdn/shop/files/Kobieta_w_bialym_topie.jpg?height=4000&amp;v=1748947833\" style=\"width: 510px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\"></strong><br></p></div></div>",
